eat  it is to get inside and destroy it from the center. You are John Leone, an ambitious pilot, ready to fire all his ammo inside the jaws of horror ! Take your space Jet and save our planet. Discover the reason why the aliens are attacking us and  experience a mysterious story behind this attack. But beside all this: SAVE OUR PLANET!<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1126420/extras/658c9c9718a3f94f377be69675e2c141.avif?t=1695711051\" /></div></li></ul></strong>",
